{
  "components": [
    {
      "text": "## Step 3 - result\n\nEverything is disabled here: this is the stored state.\n\nThis form deliberately declares **no** hide-if, so hidden_note is shown even for rows with number_a = 9. That is the point of this step: a value hidden in step 2 must still exist afterwards - on its own row. Visibility is per form, the stored value is not deleted by hiding it.",
